## 5. Recommendation

### 5.1 Primary Recommendation

**Proceed with Equitable Earth as the primary certification pathway.**

| **Rationale** | **Detail** |
| :--- | :--- |
| **Speed** | No risk map waiting; 9–12 month certification process |
| **Certainty** | DRC risk maps already available |
| **Cost Efficiency** | Transparent fee structure; "no-win, no-fee" preliminary |
| **Three Pillars** | Comprehensive assessment covers carbon, livelihoods, and ecology |

### 5.2 Secondary Recommendation

**Monitor Verra for potential future dual-certification.**

| **Rationale** | **Detail** |
| :--- | :--- |
| **Market Premium** | Verra credits trade at 10–40% premium |
| **Buyer Recognition** | Some buyers only accept Verra |
| **Second Crediting Period** | Use Verra for future expansion or second crediting period |
| **Risk Map Availability** | If maps become available, reassess dual-certification |

